whd - wayland hotkey daemon
=================================
wclip binds global hotkeys to shell commands.


Requirements
------------
wclip uses the ext-action-binder-v1 Wayland extension in addition to the base
wayland-client library.


Installation
------------
Edit config.mk to match your preferences (especially where you have the
wayland-protocols installed). Then installation is as simple as:

$ make
# make install


Usage
-----
See the man page.

Configuration
-------------
Edit config.h and (re)compile.
